        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to GET MAZED</h2><i>Frantic action. Procedural labyrinth. Co-op survival.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/c015412370f8766b6d0974dcc17f0965.avif?t=1773608917\" width=960 height=360 /></span><br><br><strong>GET MAZED</strong> is a ruthless PvE action roguelite set in a Dark Fantasy universe. Solo or in co-op, dive into an unforgiving procedurally generated labyrinth. Explore every room, wield deadly weapons, and face hordes of monsters to challenge the Warden of the Maze.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>An Unpredictable Labyrinth:</strong> Explore a procedural dungeon where every run is unique.<br></li><li> <strong>Fast-Paced Melee Combat:</strong> Wield spears, swords, and axes in visceral clashes.<br></li><li> <strong>Unleashed Action:</strong> Carve a bloody path through hordes without interruption.<br></li><li> <strong>True Co-op:</strong> Join forces to survive and complete team objectives.<br></li><li> <strong>The Warden of the Maze:</strong> Defeat the final Boss of the zone to claim victory.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISCERAL AND RUTHLESS COMBAT</h2>Here, action comes first. Combat is immediate, brutal, and designed to be satisfying. No complex management, just you, your weapon, and hordes of creatures. Carve your way through waves of monsters, use your mobility to dodge attacks, and enjoy a feeling of power with every impact.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/a8787cf495b164f9f19bd505d8faab69.poster.avif?t=1773608917\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/a8787cf495b164f9f19bd505d8faab69.webm?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/a8787cf495b164f9f19bd505d8faab69.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRENGTH IN NUMBERS</h2>Face the labyrinth as a lone wolf or form an elite squad. Coordination and reactivity will dictate your life expectancy.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Zone Objectives:</strong> Activate ancient mechanisms and survive ambushes together.<br></li><li> <strong>Gear Up:</strong> Scavenge the maze to find the perfect weapon for your playstyle.<br></li><li> <strong>Tactical Clarity:</strong> Keep control of the chaos thanks to a clear low-poly art direction.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.poster.avif?t=1773608917\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.webm?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CONSTANTLY MUTATING LABYRINTH</h2>Explore dark and hostile environments under constant tension. The maze interconnects various procedural zones: dark crypts, crowded arenas, trial rooms, and epic boss fights. Adaptability is your best ally.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.poster.avif?t=1773608917\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.webm?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the maze. Your ultimate test of survival starts here!</h2>",
