o/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/a8787cf495b164f9f19bd505d8faab69.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRENGTH IN NUMBERS</h2>Face the labyrinth as a lone wolf or form an elite squad. Coordination and reactivity will dictate your life expectancy.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Zone Objectives:</strong> Activate ancient mechanisms and survive ambushes together.<br></li><li> <strong>Gear Up:</strong> Scavenge the maze to find the perfect weapon for your playstyle.<br></li><li> <strong>Tactical Clarity:</strong> Keep control of the chaos thanks to a clear low-poly art direction.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.poster.avif?t=1773608917\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.webm?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/bf1e73d124ca4846905412df0e7a8ad2.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CONSTANTLY MUTATING LABYRINTH</h2>Explore dark and hostile environments under constant tension. The maze interconnects various procedural zones: dark crypts, crowded arenas, trial rooms, and epic boss fights. Adaptability is your best ally.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.poster.avif?t=1773608917\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.webm?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902500/extras/16c11fb6a9e53f3bec22d20b0589e636.mp4?t=1773608917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the maze. Your ultimate test of survival starts here!</h2>",
